rdodi-research:KnownLimitations_v6_2_0 rdfs:label "Known structural limitations carried into v6.2.0"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "RESIDUAL STRUCTURAL DEFECTS (not auto-patched, require expert review): (a) ~30 isolated classes — classes with no rdfs:subClassOf to a domain superclass, only owl:Thing implicit; (b) 1 subClassOf cycle involving Authorship (class is reachable from itself via non-reflexive subClassOf path); (c) 406 individuals typed by anonymous owl:Restriction class expressions — valid OWL DL but a quality smell. These are scheduled for v6.3.0 expert-review pass."@en .

